WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440
The calendar flips: Christmas Day,
then day after day of feasting,

2
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.460
to the very last night.

3
00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:12.520
In a great house after midnight, a knight
and his friends sing round a table.

4
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:13.910
The door opens.

5
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.630
There stands the steward,
in his nightgown,

6
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.590
his chain round his neck.

7
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.950
Sir Toby fires back: "Dost thou
think, because thou art virtuous,

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.490
there shall be no more cakes and ale?"

9
00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.650
So once the party starts,
who's really in charge?

10
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.880
In this mission, you'll find
out what Twelfth Night was,

11
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:36.200
and who led the revels as Lord of Misrule.

12
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:40.130
And you'll see why some people in
Shakespeare's day wanted parties like this one

13
00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.440
stopped.

14
00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:45.500
Your mission: work out who
rules once the party starts.
